@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people

### API tests
### Create Helen
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Helen",
    "lastName": "Donaghy",
    "frequencyDays": 3,
    "lastContacted": null,
    "openers": ["How has your week been?"]
}

### Create Michael
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Michael",
    "lastName": "Donaghy",
    "frequencyDays": 7,
    "lastContacted": null,
    "openers": ["What have you been up to recently?"]
}

### Get all People
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people HTTP/1.1

### delete test person by id
DELETE {{{{endpoint}}}}/(enterID) HTTP/1.1


### zod tests 
### Valid Person
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Helen",
    "lastName": "Donaghy",
    "frequencyDays": 3,
    "lastContacted": null
}

### Invalid Person
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": "Donaghy",
    "frequencyDays": -5
}

### Invalid Interaction
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/interactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "personId": "invalid",
    "date": "2026-10-11",
    "type": "telephone"
}




### Create Person
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Person",
  "frequencyDays": 7,
  "lastContacted": null,
  "openers": ["How are you?"]
}

### create new person
POST {{{endpoint}}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "frequencyDays": 7,
  "lastContacted": null,
  "openers": ["How are you?"]
}

